	(text "Zasilanie: VBUS 5 V -> TI TPSM828302 (modul buck 2 A z cewka, 2 MHz) -> +3V3. VOUT = 0,5 V x (1 + R35/R36) = 3,30 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a935de94-d92e-43bd-ae71-222888832fa7")
	)
	(text "VCCIO1A..8 = +3V3 bezposrednio; VCCA1..6 = +3V3 przez ferryt FB2; VCC_ONE = +3V3 przez ferryt FB3 (uklad SA: jedno napiecie 3,3 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "63ba7d39-fadc-47c5-a933-0f2e88ef2ba7")
	)
	(text "TPSM828302 (SLVSGM1D): CIN >= 4,7u X7R przy VIN (C16), COUT >= 12u efektywnie (C18 47u). R36 200k..600k (1%). MODE = GND (auto PSM/PWM). EN z VBUS przez R23/C17. PG, SW niepodlaczone."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1e927eae-8d6c-409e-bfed-f1fde38388ef")
	)
	(text "Footprint TPSM828302ARDSR (QFN-FCMOD-9 3x3 mm, RDS0009A) - do narysowania wg land pattern TI (pady 6 VOUT i 8 SW duze), SW tylko maly pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3acc0872-f54e-48cb-9bde-9bc7ad71665d")
	)
	(text "U1 = 10M08SAE144, ADC nieuzywany: ANAIN1 i REFGND do GND, ADC_VREF NC (wytyczne MAX 10). Bez MCP1525."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 39.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "12f9778a-7144-4404-8805-e39b99cae7bd")
	)
